# Test Scenarios - SUT Staging

This file contains detailed test scenarios for documenting the SUT system.
This is a template that will be gitignored - copy to TEST-SCENARIO.md for actual testing.

## Overview

- **Staging URL**: https://stag-app.mfardiansyah.id/
- **Backend API**: https://ai-backend-000000000000.asia-southeast1.run.app
- **Documentation Output**: playwright-docs/output/

## Role-based Test Scenarios

### 1. Super Admin (KG prefix credentials)

**Credential**: `USER2024001` / `<staging-password>`

| ID | Feature | Steps | Expected Result |
|----|---------|-------|----------------|
| SA-001 | Login | Navigate to /auth/login, enter credentials, click Login | Successful login to dashboard |
| SA-002 | Dashboard | View outpatient dashboard | Dashboard loads with menu items |
| SA-003 | User Management | Navigate to /administration/user | User list displays |

