## Test Execution Order

1. Login flows (prerequisite for all roles)
2. Dashboard flows
3. Feature-specific flows (patient, prescription, billing, etc.)
4. Edge case flows (error handling, validation)

## Notes

- All credentials share common password: `<staging-password>`
- Add delays between steps for stability
- Capture screenshots at each step for documentation
- Record video for complex flows